---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Daily Notes
description: One page for each day in the notebook.
permalink: /thoughts/notes/daily/index.html
---
<article class="listing-page"><header class="page-heading"><a class="back-link" href="{{ '/thoughts/notes/' | url }}">← Notes</a><p class="eyebrow">THOUGHTS / DAILY</p><h1>Daily Notes</h1><p class="lede">A chronological record of observations and things learned.</p></header><ol class="entry-list">{% for item in collections.dailyNotes | reverse %}<li><a class="project-row" href="{{ item.url | url }}"><span class="row-number">{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="row-title">{{ item.data.title }}<span class="project-peek">{{ item.data.description }}</span></span><time class="row-status">{{ item.data.date | date }}</time><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ol></article>
